      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1773320000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "fetch_reason is the precise outcome;\nfetch_status is derived from it by a single\nmapping function, so they cannot disagree.\nfetch_error is diagnostic only \u2014 nothing\ndownstream branches on its contents.\nOn failure the journalist\u2019s paste is kept.",
      "originalText": "fetch_reason is the precise outcome;\nfetch_status is derived from it by a single\nmapping function, so they cannot disagree.\nfetch_error is diagnostic only \u2014 nothing\ndownstream branches on its contents.\nOn failure the journalist\u2019s paste is kept.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
