      "text": "fetch_status             ok | empty | error | skipped (derived)\nfetch_reason             precise outcome \u2014 taxonomy below\nfetch_error              diagnostic only; never branch on it\nhttp_status              final HTTP code, if a response arrived\nfinal_url                URL after redirects\ncontent_type             response type/subtype\nredirect_chain           request \u2192 \u2026 \u2192 final_url\nresponse_bytes           encoded body size, when known\nretry_after              Retry-After header value, if sent\nextracted_char_count     fetched body length (0 if skipped)",
